# W2's third E2 batch: the discriminating scenario (24 session trees replaying the 48 traces with the largest contexts,
# weka-x32-long, so the 36,400-token pool holds two or three agent contexts) across arms 4 to 8, and SGLang with its
# host tier (HiCache, write-through, 4x) at 8 and 16 sessions for KV-tier parity with vLLM's CPU tier. One run of each;
# the best of each arm is repeated in W4 with arm 9. Grouped by engine, so the engine restarts six times.
#   benchmarks/e2/campaign.sh benchmarks/e2/w2c.campaign

